{"parentUuid":"b2946811-f3fb-446f-9907-a5c83891682a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdCiLH9dS1PD85TbbTgTV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01J9mU2D1FAegpVb5Fhfda1P","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/veerendra/.claude/projects/-home-veerendra-farmer-yourfamilyfarmer/memory/project_delivery_charge.md","content":"---\nname: project_delivery_charge\ndescription: Moderator-set delivery charge (base + per-extra-farmer) with checkout-aware refunds; built 2026-07-20, not pushed\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nDelivery charge feature built 2026-07-20 on `staging`, **NOT pushed, migration NOT applied**.\n\nModel: one charge per checkout = `base + extra × (farmers − 1)`. Defaults base ₹30 / extra ₹15, moderator-editable. Every distinct farmer in the checkout counts toward the extra (even self-pickup), gated on the checkout having ≥1 home-delivery line. See [[project_per_harvest_delivery]] and [[project_platform_fee]] (mirrors that pattern).\n\nKey architecture fact: a multi-farmer cart is placed as **one order batch + one Razorpay payment per farmer** (Cart loops `farmerGroups`, separate idempotency key each). To link them, added `orders.checkout_id`. Base stamped on the first farmer's batch, extra on each other; stamped fees across a checkout sum to the formula.\n\nRefunds (farmer decline + buyer cancel share `planDeliveryRefund` in `src/lib/delivery-fee.ts`, pure + unit-checked): recompute participating-farmer count, refund the drop — ₹extra when a non-last farmer leaves, the whole remaining held when the last leaves. `orders.delivery_fee_refunded` tracks partial refunds so a residual base stuck on an already-cancelled base row is returned (across sibling payments) when the last farmer finally leaves. `src/lib/delivery-refund.ts` issues the sibling-payment refunds. Legacy null-checkout_id orders keep old per-order behavior.\n\nImportant change: delivery fee is now **charged online** (added to Razorpay create amount; COD deposit already folded it via computeCodSplit) so it's refundable — previously it was `DELIVERY_FEE_RUPEES=0` collected as cash by the rider. That constant is **removed**.\n\nFiles: `scripts/delivery-charge-migration.sql` (platform_settings.delivery_base_fee/delivery_extra_fee + orders.checkout_id + orders.delivery_fee_refunded — run in BOTH prod & staging), `src/lib/delivery-fee.ts`, `src/lib/delivery-refund.ts`, `src/app/api/moderator/delivery-fee/route.ts` + DeliveryChargeCard on `/moderator`, place/razorpay-create/decline/cancel routes, Cart + consumer order-detail display. No moderator order-decline route exists, so moderator parity = the config card only.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1545,"cache_read_input_tokens":178777,"output_tokens":2084,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1545,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2084,"cache_read_input_tokens":178777,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1545,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1545},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdCiLFUfus6K9YZsjimjs","type":"assistant","uuid":"ffb75223-53ec-4b64-9d57-e29899e4d537","timestamp":"2026-07-20T04:55:29.027Z","effort":"high","session_id":"b6577fe7-68cf-4607-bdd4-71d04060cfcc","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/veerendra/farmer/yourfamilyfarmer","sessionId":"b6577fe7-68cf-4607-bdd4-71d04060cfcc","version":"2.1.212","gitBranch":"staging"}
