{"parentUuid":"371b0f4a-7215-44d4-a662-e77a63618cf0","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d3b6d7a8-bd7b-4f4a-8834-d867f1fc08f3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013wsxKhmXkfNTUoPf4mQ8Qm","type":"tool_result","content":"Updated task #7 status"}]},"uuid":"1cc3f815-bee6-4f7c-81c9-514bfbebff98","timestamp":"2026-07-20T04:55:31.901Z","toolUseResult":{"success":true,"taskId":"7","updatedFields":["status"],"statusChange":{"from":"in_progress","to":"completed"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"371b0f4a-7215-44d4-a662-e77a63618cf0","session_id":"b6577fe7-68cf-4607-bdd4-71d04060cfcc","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/veerendra/farmer/yourfamilyfarmer","sessionId":"b6577fe7-68cf-4607-bdd4-71d04060cfcc","version":"2.1.212","gitBranch":"staging"}
{"parentUuid":"1cc3f815-bee6-4f7c-81c9-514bfbebff98","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdCiNUfEZHDFFuQygadFy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. Built on `staging`, **not pushed**, migration **not applied** (per your ask-before-push rule). `npm run build` is clean and I proved the refund math against all six cases below.\n\n## What I built\n\n**The model** — one delivery charge per checkout = `base + extra × (farmers − 1)`, defaults ₹30 / ₹15, both moderator-editable. Every distinct farmer counts toward the extra (your choice), gated on the checkout having at least one home-delivery line.\n\n**Moderator config** (the parity piece — moderator has no order-decline surface, so the config card *is* the moderator work):\n- `DeliveryChargeCard` on `/moderator` (two inputs: *Delivery base charge*, *Additional charge / extra farmer*) + `GET/POST /api/moderator/delivery-fee`, same pattern as the platform fee.\n\n**Charging** — a multi-farmer cart is placed as one order + one payment *per farmer*, so I added `orders.checkout_id` to link them. Base is stamped on the first farmer's batch, extra on each other; the Razorpay charge now **includes** the delivery fee (previously excluded/cash) so it's refundable.\n\n**Refunds** — farmer-decline and buyer-cancel now share one pure `planDeliveryRefund`, recomputing the participating-farmer count and refunding the drop, with `orders.delivery_fee_refunded` tracking partials so a base stuck on an already-cancelled row is returned across sibling payments when the last farmer leaves. Legacy (null `checkout_id`) orders keep the old behavior.\n\n**Consumer visibility** — Cart shows each farmer's share (base / \"extra farmer delivery\"); order-detail shows the *Delivery charge* line in the total.\n\n## Verified — all six cases pass\n\n```\nPASS Case4 (1 farmer/1 item reject)      owed=30\nPASS Case5 (1 of 2 items, farmer stays)  owed=0\nPASS Case6 (2 farmers, one rejects)      owed=15\nPASS base-holder rejects first           owed=15  (residual base retained)\nPASS ...then last farmer leaves          owed=30  (residual returned across both payments)\nPASS Case5 then last item declined       owed=30\nPASS 3 farmers, one extra drops          owed=15\n```\n\n## Before this ships — you'll need to\n1. **Run `scripts/delivery-charge-migration.sql` in both prod and staging** (adds the two settings columns + `checkout_id` + `delivery_fee_refunded`). Until it runs, charges fall back to the ₹30/₹15 defaults and refunds keep old behavior.\n2. Set the charges on `/moderator` (defaults already ₹30/₹15).\n\nTwo decisions I made on your behalf (you didn't answer #1–3 explicitly): pure-pickup checkouts pay ₹0; moderator inputs capped at ₹1000; built on staging, unpushed. One minor known gap: the farmer-side decline *preview* (`DeclineSheets`) still estimates the buyer's refund as this row's full `total + delivery + platform`, so for a multi-farmer base-holder it can read ₹15 high — the server refunds the correct amount; only the preview label is approximate. Want me to tighten that preview, or leave it?\n\nSay the word and I'll commit + push."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2350,"cache_read_input_tokens":180322,"output_tokens":1120,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2350,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1120,"cache_read_input_tokens":180322,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2350,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2350},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdCiNS2jFyKwGdbbdijY6","type":"assistant","uuid":"7043f1fa-6700-4c81-862a-49d07d4a513f","timestamp":"2026-07-20T04:55:49.917Z","effort":"high",